{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRz9CNQXdzM4iejzgpJY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've made the fixes and written ANSWER.md. I only checked that `server.py` compiles, and I haven't run the flow against Intervals.icu.\n\nThe four causes, which the ANSWER.md also lists:\n1. **Connect button:** it was a plain link to a GET endpoint. A page navigation doesn't send the `Authorization` header, so every athlete got a 401. Init is now an authenticated POST that returns `{authorize_url}`, and the button fetches it and navigates there.\n2. **Authorize 400 error:** the scope list named `ACTIVITY` and `CALENDAR` twice, once as `:READ` and once as `:WRITE`. I changed it to `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`. The log shows only a generic 400, so this comes from your colleague's note rather than anything I confirmed. Please check it against Intervals.\n3. **Rivera told to reconnect after an hour:** Intervals tokens have no refresh token or expiry, but the code assumed a 3600-second lifetime and marked the connection expired. I removed the TTL and the refresh thread. A 401 from the Intervals API now marks the connection \"expired, reconnect\".\n4. **Token exchange:** I trimmed the request to `client_id`, `client_secret` and `code`. Nothing in the logs shows this was failing, so it's a precaution.\n\nTwo things from the note I did not apply. I kept the existing signed `state` instead of switching to a JWT, and I didn't add token encryption because the store is in memory. I did apply the check that rejects a reconnect with a different Intervals athlete. ANSWER.md says which parts of the note applied."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":118,"cache_read_input_tokens":32661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":118},"output_tokens":563,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1da5bb28-12c9-458e-971f-b702b9dd49b8","uuid":"b7f9f532-50ad-4f4d-b667-63c7ef92fbec","timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:53:33.278Z","request_id":"req_011CgRz9C6YKifMsBN93Gtet"}
